    <detaileddescription>
<para>Lightweight, read-only description of an ONNX operator schema at one specific opset version.</para>
<para>A <ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1onnx__op_1_1LightOpSchema" kindref="compound">LightOpSchema</ref> captures everything that documentation and validation tools need about a single versioned operator: its name, domain, the opset version it was introduced in, its documentation string, the formal inputs and outputs, and the type constraints that govern them. </para>
